{"resourceIdentifier":"4072","resourceName":"Fazenda Boa Vista afforestation project","description":"The Fazenda Boa Vista Afforestation (ARR) Project is restoring 293 hectares of degraded land in the transition zone between the Cerrado and Atlantic Rainforest biomes in Minas Gerais, Brazil. Historically, the area suffered from deforestation, extensive cattle ranching, and recurring burns, leading to soil depletion, habitat loss, and water pollution.\r\nThe project is expected to capture 428,486 tCO2e over 20 years, with an average annual GHG removal of 21,424 tCO2e, by planting high-absorbing tree species and promoting natural ecosystem recovery. Beyond carbon sequestration, it enhances biodiversity, restores ecosystem services, and benefits local communities, making it a comprehensive environmental and climate solution.","location":{"latitude":-16.641998,"longitude":-41.331000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-06","endExclusive":"2023-03-09","endInclusive":"2023-03-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4072"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Minas Gerais"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CARBON CREDITS CONSULTING S.R.L."},{"type":"string","value":"BOLOGNA, Italy"},{"type":"string","value":"+39 392 9050342"},{"type":"string","value":"asc@carboncreditsconsulting.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21424"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ARR"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AR-ACM0003"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_ACREAGE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"29